---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms of Service | HealthChrono"
  description="Review the HealthChrono Terms of Service, including our Medical Disclaimer, subscription terms, acceptable use, and limitation of liability."
>
  <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white py-16 border-b border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-900/60 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30 mb-4">
        Legal Agreement
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight font-heading">HealthChrono Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400 text-sm">
        <strong>Last Updated:</strong> September 25, 2026 &bull; Effective Date: September 25, 2026
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none space-y-8 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        
        <!-- HIGH-PRIORITY MEDICAL DISCLAIMER -->
        <section class="bg-amber-50 border-2 border-amber-300 rounded-2xl p-6 text-sm text-amber-950">
          <h2 class="text-amber-900 font-extrabold text-base mb-2 font-heading flex items-center gap-2">
            ⚠️ MANDATORY MEDICAL DISCLAIMER: NOT MEDICAL ADVICE
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            <strong>HEALTHCHRONO IS NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE, CLINICAL DIAGNOSTIC TOOL, OR TELEHEALTH MEDICAL PROVIDER.</strong>
          </p>
          <p class="mb-3">
            The HealthChrono application, its website, features, clinical PDF reports, medication reminders, and informational summaries are provided exclusively for self-tracking, organizational, and informational purposes. 
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 mb-3">
            <li>Never disregard professional medical advice or delay seeking medical evaluation because of information or summaries generated by HealthChrono.</li>
            <li>Always consult your physician, pharmacist, or licensed healthcare specialist concerning any medical condition, symptom flare-up, or prescription dosage adjustments.</li>
            <li><strong>IN CASE OF A MEDICAL EMERGENCY:</strong> Call 911 (in the United States) or your local emergency emergency number, or proceed to the nearest emergency room immediately. Do not rely on HealthChrono for emergency triage or acute medical care.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading mb-3">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By downloading, installing, accessing, or using the <strong>HealthChrono</strong> mobile application or website (<a href="https://gethealthchrono.com" class="text-emerald-600 underline">https://gethealthchrono.com</a>), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service ("Terms") and our <a href="/privacy" class="text-emerald-600 underline">Privacy Policy</a>. If you do not agree to these Terms, you must not access or use HealthChrono.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading mb-3">2. Eligibility & User Accounts</h2>
          <p>
            You must be at least 13 years of age (or 16 in the European Economic Area) to use HealthChrono. By creating an account, you represent and warrant that:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
            <li>All registration information you submit is accurate, current, and complete.</li>
            <li>You will safeguard your login credentials and immediately notify us of any unauthorized account access.</li>
            <li>You are solely responsible for all activities and data logged under your account credentials.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading mb-3">3. Subscriptions, Payments & Billing</h2>
          <p>
            HealthChrono offers both free base features and premium subscription tiers ("HealthChrono Pro") that unlock enhanced functionality such as unlimited history, multi-profile tracking, and high-resolution clinical PDF exports.
          </p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-4 mb-2">3.1 App Store Billing</h3>
          <p>
            Subscriptions are purchased directly through the Apple App Store (iOS) or Google Play Store (Android). All billing, payment transactions, payment processing, renewals, and refunds are managed strictly by Apple Inc. or Google LLC in accordance with their applicable terms of sale.
          </p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-4 mb-2">3.2 Auto-Renewal & Cancellation</h3>
          <p>
            Subscriptions automatically renew unless auto-renew is disabled at least 24 hours prior to the conclusion of the current subscription billing period. You may manage or cancel your subscription at any time within your device's Apple ID Subscriptions settings or Google Play Account Subscriptions settings.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading mb-3">4. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
          <p>
            HealthChrono, including its software, user interface design, logo, visual assets, text, typography, algorithms, and documentation, is the exclusive intellectual property of HealthChrono Inc. and is protected by copyright, trademark, and other applicable intellectual property laws. You are granted a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to use the application for your personal, non-commercial health management.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading mb-3">5. User Data & Ownership</h2>
          <p>
            You retain 100% ownership of the personal health logs, symptom ratings, medication regimens, and notes that you enter into HealthChrono. You grant us only the limited license necessary to host, store, back up, and process that content solely to provide the application's features to you. You may export or delete your data at any time.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading mb-3">6. Acceptable Use Restrictions</h2>
          <p>You agree not to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
            <li>Decompile, reverse engineer, disassemble, or attempt to derive the source code of HealthChrono.</li>
            <li>Circumvent or attempt to disable any cryptographic protections, biometric locks, or security features.</li>
            <li>Use the application for any unlawful, fraudulent, or malicious purpose.</li>
            <li>Misrepresent yourself or impersonate any person or entity in connection with your account.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading mb-3">7. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
          <p class="uppercase text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500">
            TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW:
          </p>
