            These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Michigan, United States, without regard to conflict of law principles. Any legal proceedings arising under these Terms shall be instituted exclusively in the federal or state courts located in Michigan.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading mb-3">11. Changes to Terms</h2>
          <p>
            We reserve the right to revise these Terms periodically. We will provide reasonable notice of material updates through an in-app prompt or by updating the "Last Updated" date at the top of this document. Your continued use of HealthChrono after revisions take effect constitutes your agreement to the modified Terms.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-heading mb-3">12. Contact Information</h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions, feedback, or legal inquiries concerning these Terms of Service:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 p-5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl space-y-1 text-sm">
            <p><strong>HealthChrono Inc.</strong></p>
            <p>Attn: Legal Affairs</p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:info@drit.ninja" class="text-emerald-600 font-semibold underline">info@drit.ninja</a></p>
            <p>Website: <a href="https://gethealthchrono.com" class="text-emerald-600 font-semibold underline">https://gethealthchrono.com</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
